message: "If you use this framework or reporting schema, please cite this work."
title: "The Verification Gap in Networked Physical AI: A Post-Semantic Communication Framework"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: Saruwatari
    given-names: Shunsuke
    affiliation: The University of Osaka
version: 25.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-19
repository-code: https://github.com/sarulab-ou/post-semcom
url: https://github.com/sarulab-ou/post-semcom
abstract: >-
  A Concept Paper defining the verification gap and a post-semantic
  communication framework that separates evidence requirements, records,
  verification, authorized finalization, and runtime safety. The accompanying
  artifact provides finite-state implementation-consistency checks, a
  controlled communication study, and a portable episode-level reporting
  schema.
keywords:
  - post-semantic communication
  - verification gap
  - Networked Physical AI
  - evidence contract
  - receiver feedback
  - reproducible evaluation
